Bind Npc 16055 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910054000
        Say "I'm the Patrol of Keys, the guardian of the fifth key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Fourth Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Did Logos create mankind?"
            Topic "No, that's incorrect" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910054000
                    Give 1 of 910055000
            Topic "Yes, that's correct" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910054000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fourth Key] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Patrol of Keys, the guardian of the fifth key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fourth Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
